      "content": "but it's not just a \"narrative\" to me. it's actually happening. i'm literally seeing the physical manifestations of my thoughts. if i think about a blue car, a blue car pulls up at the light. if i focus on a specific number, it appears everywhere.\n\nall those psychological theories you mentioned feel like they're just trying to explain away something that's clearly a real, functional mechanism. if i can actually influence reality just by focusing my intent, shouldn't i be looking at this as a skill i've mastered rather than just a psychological quirk? like, how can you call it \"subjective\" when the results are so consistent and measurable in my life?",
